{:edb/db-before-t 2059 :edb/db-after-t 2060 :edb/tx-data [[13194139535372 50 #inst "2026-10-08T23:00:52.493Z" 13194139535372 true] [17592186105660 1020 #edb/ref 17592186346420 13194139535372 true] [17592186105660 1020 #edb/ref 17592186346427 13194139535372 true] [17592186105660 1020 #edb/ref 17592186346430 13194139535372 true] [17592186106053 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139535372 true] [17592186106053 1100 "Find $\\mathbf{b} \\cdot  ( \\mathbf{c} \\times  \\mathbf{a} )$, if $- \\mathbf{a} \\cdot  ( 3 \\mathbf{b} \\times  ( - 2 \\mathbf{c} ) ) = 24.$." 13194139535372 false] [17592186106053 1100 "Find $b\\cdot (c\\times a)$, if $-a\\cdot (3b\\times (-2c))=24.$" 13194139535372 true] [17592186106053 1145 "First, we factor out the constants and get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-a\\cdot (3b\\times (-2c)) & =24 \\\\ (-1)\\cdot 3\\cdot (-2)\\cdot [a\\cdot (b\\times c)] & =24 \\\\ a\\cdot (b\\times c) & =4.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we swap $a$ and $b$ to get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}b\\cdot (a\\times c) & =-4,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nand again we swap $a$ and $c$ to get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}b\\cdot (c\\times a) & =4.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535372 true] [17592186346420 1017 #edb/ref 17592186346421 13194139535372 true] [17592186346420 1089 "q-18657" 13194139535372 true] [17592186346420 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139535372 true] [17592186346420 1100 "Let $a=⟨-2,0,1⟩$, $b=⟨5,2,-4⟩$ and $c=⟨1,0,3⟩.$ Find $a\\cdot (b\\times c).$" 13194139535372 true] [17592186346420 1113 #uuid "ecba9148-cd7e-592d-a086-629bf7bd2038" 13194139535372 true] [17592186346420 1145 "Remember that the scalar triple product $a\\cdot (b\\times c)$ is just the determinant of the matrix whose rows are given by $a,$ $b,$ and $c.$\n\nSo, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a\\cdot (b\\times c) & =|\\begin{aligned}-2 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 5 & 2 & -4 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 3\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =(-2)\\cdot |\\begin{aligned}2 & -4 \\\\ 0 & 3\\end{aligned}|-0\\cdot |\\begin{aligned}5 & -4 \\\\ 1 & 3\\end{aligned}|+1\\cdot |\\begin{aligned}5 & 2 \\\\ 1 & 0\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =-2(2\\cdot 3-(-4)\\cdot 0)-0+(5\\cdot 0-2\\cdot 1) \\\\  & =-12-0-2 \\\\  & =-14.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535372 true] [17592186346421 1000 #edb/ref 17592186346422 13194139535372 true] [17592186346421 1000 #edb/ref 17592186346423 13194139535372 true] [17592186346421 1000 #edb/ref 17592186346424 13194139535372 true] [17592186346421 1000 #edb/ref 17592186346425 13194139535372 true] [17592186346421 1000 #edb/ref 17592186346426 13194139535372 true] [17592186346421 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535372 true] [17592186346421 1041 "selection" 13194139535372 true] [17592186346421 1104 #edb/ref 17592186346423 13194139535372 true] [17592186346421 1110 #uuid "aec8f281-5560-5453-9cf9-fb253deb9bc5" 13194139535372 true] [17592186346422 1034 "12" 13194139535372 true] [17592186346422 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535372 true] [17592186346422 1111 #uuid "9b522ef7-3f8b-5c59-b0c8-7c5aadf12179" 13194139535372 true] [17592186346423 1034 "-14" 13194139535372 true] [17592186346423 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535372 true] [17592186346423 1111 #uuid "61bfc71c-73df-54c6-a87e-f8bec59e4a33" 13194139535372 true] [17592186346424 1034 "2" 13194139535372 true] [17592186346424 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535372 true] [17592186346424 1111 #uuid "978d879a-c752-50ed-ae4a-87922ffd9fde" 13194139535372 true] [17592186346425 1034 "0" 13194139535372 true] [17592186346425 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535372 true] [17592186346425 1111 #uuid "56bd9b55-2d4f-5f8e-a965-b29486106bfd" 13194139535372 true] [17592186346426 1034 "-2" 13194139535372 true] [17592186346426 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535372 true] [17592186346426 1111 #uuid "2fe82d2f-f231-5e9b-8afb-65150b4fbe9a" 13194139535372 true] [17592186346427 1017 #edb/ref 17592186346428 13194139535372 true] [17592186346427 1089 "q-317325" 13194139535372 true] [17592186346427 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139535372 true] [17592186346427 1100 "Let $a=⟨-1,-2,3⟩$, $b=⟨4,-1,-2⟩$ and $c=⟨1,2,-3⟩.$ Find $a\\cdot (b\\times c)$ using a determinant.\n\n$a\\cdot (b\\times c)=$\n{{field-1}}" 13194139535372 true] [17592186346427 1113 #uuid "c0fb786c-c205-5d9a-a424-74286effcd4e" 13194139535372 true] [17592186346427 1145 "Remember that the scalar triple product $a\\cdot (b\\times c)$ is just the determinant of the matrix whose rows are given by $a,$ $b,$ and $c.$\n\nSo, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a\\cdot (b\\times c) & =|\\begin{aligned}-1 & -2 & 3 \\\\ 4 & -1 & -2 \\\\ 1 & 2 & -3\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =(-1)\\cdot |\\begin{aligned}-1 & -2 \\\\ 2 & -3\\end{aligned}|\\,-\\,(-2)\\cdot |\\begin{aligned}4 & -2 \\\\ 1 & -3\\end{aligned}|\\,+\\,3\\cdot |\\begin{aligned}4 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 2\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =(-1)\\,((-1)(-3)-(-2)\\cdot 2)\\,-\\,(-2)\\,(4\\cdot (-3)-(-2)\\cdot 1)\\,+\\,3\\,(4\\cdot 2-(-1)\\cdot 1) \\\\  & =(-1)\\,(7)\\,-\\,(-2)\\,(-10)\\,+\\,3\\,(9) \\\\  & =-7-20+27 \\\\  & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535372 true] [17592186346428 1000 #edb/ref 17592186346429 13194139535372 true] [17592186346428 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139535372 true] [17592186346428 1041 "field-1" 13194139535372 true] [17592186346428 1104 #edb/ref 17592186346429 13194139535372 true] [17592186346428 1110 #uuid "9632f951-4e44-5089-ae7f-a3d6c4779422" 13194139535372 true] [17592186346429 1034 "0" 13194139535372 true] [17592186346429 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535372 true] [17592186346429 1111 #uuid "8c5ecfdb-e402-5398-a023-358139ea8488" 13194139535372 true] [17592186346430 1017 #edb/ref 17592186346431 13194139535372 true] [17592186346430 1089 "q-73461" 13194139535372 true] [17592186346430 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139535372 true] [17592186346430 1100 "Let $p=⟨3,-2,1⟩$, $q=⟨2,-1,0⟩$ and $r=⟨1,-2,4⟩.$ Find $q\\cdot (r\\times p).$" 13194139535372 true] [17592186346430 1113 #uuid "03a4c208-a34c-5a3e-b51f-f4be25787fd5" 13194139535372 true] [17592186346430 1145 "Remember that the scalar triple product $q\\cdot (r\\times p)$ is ju